  "description": "NET/ROM networking for the Packet.NET stack: the L3 routing layer (NODES broadcasts, routing table + quality model), the L4 circuit state machine (CircuitManager / NetRomCircuit), and the INP3 time-routing overlay (L3RTT, RIF/RIP) — with BPQ / XRouter / Strict / Lenient quirk profiles pinned to real on-air behaviour. Build a .NET NET/ROM node or router on top of Packet.Ax25. Source: github.com/packet-net/packet.net.",
